@startuml
actor User
participant "User Interface" as UI
participant "File Manager" as FM
participant "Frequency Analyzer" as FA
participant "Huffman Tree" as HT
participant "Code Generator" as CG
participant "Compressor" as EN
participant "Header Manager" as HM

User -> UI : Select input file
UI -> FM : Read input
FM -> FA : Analyse file data
FA -> HT : Send frequencies
HT -> CG : Build codes
CG -> EN : Provide Huffman codes
EN -> HM : Write metadata and compressed data
HM --> UI : Compression result
UI --> User : Show status and ratio
@enduml
